		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 5 · 2 Actions · Reach 4 · Concentration: Up to 1 minute.</strong></p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 4d10. A Large or smaller target is Restrained in a bubble of water. At the start of the Restrained target's turns, it takes 6 damage as they drown. The affected target or its adjacent allies can use an Action to make a STR save, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
			"higherLevelEffect": "",
			"upcastEffect": "<p><strong>Upcast:</strong> +6 Restrained damage or +1 minute duration. If 9 mana is spent, gains Burst: 3, can still crit or miss.</p>"
